ose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>分层</strong>：将 PS 分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 个层，层内比较治疗效果</li>\n<li><strong>协变量调整</strong>：将 PS 作为回归模型中的协变量</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>工具变量法</strong>（IV）利用仅通过治疗途径影响结局的外生变量来估计因果效应。在药物流行病学中常用的工具变量包括医生处方偏好（Physician Prescribing Preference）和地理变异。IV 估计的是局部平均处理效应（LATE）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LATE = \\frac{E[Y|Z=1] - E[Y|Z=0]}{E[A|Z=1] - E[A|Z=0]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>高维倾向性评分</strong>（hdPS）由 Schneeweiss 等人提出，通过算法自动从大型索赔数据库中数百个诊断和处方编码中筛选潜在混杂因素，克服了研究者手动选择变量的局限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"rwe-的监管应用场景\">RWE 的监管应用场景</h3><p>FDA 的 RWE 框架将应用场景分为多个层次：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[RWE 监管应用] --&gt; B[药品安全监测]&#10;    A --&gt; C[适应症扩展]&#10;    A --&gt; D[上市后要求]&#10;    A --&gt; E[审批支持证据]&#10;    &#10;    B --&gt; B1[信号检测与确认]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[REMS 评估]&#10;    &#10;    C --&gt; C1[单臂试验外部对照]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[罕见病自然史研究]&#10;    &#10;    D --&gt; D1[加速审批后确证]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[长期安全性监测]&#10;    &#10;    E --&gt; E1[实用性临床试验]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[注册研究]\">graph TD\n    A[RWE 监管应用] --&gt; B[药品安全监测]\n    A --&gt; C[适应症扩展]\n    A --&gt; D[上市后要求]\n    A --&gt; E[审批支持证据]\n    \n    B --&gt; B1[信号检测与确认]\n    B --&gt; B2[REMS 评估]\n    \n    C --&gt; C1[单臂试验外部对照]\n    C --&gt; C2[罕见病自然史研究]\n    \n    D --&gt; D1[加速审批后确证]\n    D --&gt; D2[长期安全性监测]\n    \n    E --&gt; E1[实用性临床试验]\n    E --&gt; E2[注册研究]</pre><p>里程碑案例包括：Ibrance（palbociclib）基于 RWE 获得男性乳腺癌适应症扩展（2019）；FDA Sentinel 系统利用超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 亿人的分布式数据网络进行主动安全监测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据质量与研究报告标准\">数据质量与研究报告标准</h3><p>RWE 研究的可信度高度依赖于数据质量和分析透明度。关键质量维度包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>完整性</strong>：关键变量缺失率，特别是结局变量和时间戳</li>\n<li><strong>准确性</strong>：诊断编码与临床实际的一致性，需通过病例验证（Chart Review）确认阳性预测值（PPV），通常要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PPV \\geq 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>一致性</strong>：编码规则在不同时期和机构间的稳定性</li>\n<li><strong>及时性</strong>：数据从产生到可用的延迟时间</li>\n</ul>\n<p>ISPE-ISPOR 联合发布的 REPEAT（REporting of studies Conducted using Observational Routinely-collected health Data）清单和 STROBE 扩展为 RWE 研究报告提供了标准化框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某制药公司希望利用 RWD 支持一种已上市肿瘤药物的新适应症申请。请设计一个目标试验模拟研究方案，明确：目标试验的关键设计要素、RWD 数据源选择、混杂控制策略、以及研究结果可能面临的主要偏倚。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在使用倾向性评分匹配比较两种降糖药物的心血管安全性时，匹配后发现某个关键混杂因素（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HbA_{1c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 基线值）的标准化均数差（SMD）仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.15</span></span></span></span></span>（通常要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 0.10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span>）。你将如何应对这一残余不平衡？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么&quot;不朽时间偏倚&quot;（Immortal Time Bias）是 RWE 研究中最常见且最具欺骗性的偏倚之一？请用一个药物流行病学研究的实例说明其产生机制和纠正方法。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 EHR 数据和医保索赔数据作为 RWE 数据源时，在结局定义准确性、随访完整性和适用研究问题方面的权衡。对于评估一种新型抗凝药物的出血风险，你推荐使用哪种数据源？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>FDA (2018)</strong>：《Framework for FDA&#39;s Real-World Evidence Program》——FDA RWE 框架性文件</li>\n<li><strong>Hernán, M.A. &amp; Robins, J.M. (2016)</strong>：&quot;Using Big Data to Emulate a Target Trial When a Randomized Trial Is Not Available&quot;，American Journal of Epidemiology——目标试验模拟的方法论基础</li>\n<li><strong>Schneeweiss, S. et al. (2009)</strong>：&quot;High-Dimensional Propensity Score Adjustment in Studies of Treatment Effects Using Health Care Claims Data&quot;，Epidemiology——hdPS 方法的原始论文</li>\n<li><strong>Wang, S.V. et al. (2022)</strong>：&quot;STaRT-RWE: Structured Template for Planning and Reporting on the Implementation of Real World Evidence Studies&quot;，BMJ——RWE 研究规划与报告模板</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>真实世界证据通过对常规医疗实践中产生的数据进行严谨分析，弥补了 RCT 在外部有效性、长期随访和特殊人群研究方面的不足。目标试验模拟框架为 RWE 研究提供了清晰的因果推断逻辑，倾向性评分等统计方法为混杂控制提供了技术手段。随着数据基础设施的完善和分析方法的进步，RWE 在监管决策和临床实践中的角色将持续扩大，但数据质量保障和分析透明度仍是其可信度的根本。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 真实世界证据","id":"研究生-临床研究方法-真实世界证据"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"真实世界数据的来源与特征","id":"真实世界数据的来源与特征"},{"level":3,"text":"RWE 的研究设计框架","id":"rwe-的研究设计框架"},{"level":3,"text":"混杂控制方法","id":"混杂控制方法"},{"level":3,"text":"RWE 的监管应用场景","id":"rwe-的监管应用场景"},{"level":3,"text":"数据质量与研究报告标准","id":"数据质量与研究报告标准"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 临床研究方法 — 卫生经济学评价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/medicine/clinical-research-methods/outcomes-research/health-economics-evaluation"},"next":null}